2. Insert at the End

Suppose:

10 → 20 → 30 → None

We want to insert 40.

Result:

10 → 20 → 30 → 40 → None
Code
def insert_end(self, data):
    new_node = Node(data)

    if self.head is None:
        self.head = new_node
        return

    current = self.head

    while current.next is not None:
        current = current.next

    current.next = new_node
